{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKdAV3p6Us8QZx9JwUXJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The rules were nested under `.filterForm .formField` in the reports app's CSS module. Their `.cds--date-picker`, `.cds--select`, `.cds--select-input` and `.cds--date-picker__input` selectors were never `:global`, so the CSS-modules build localized them to hashed names that Carbon's markup never carries. They were removed in commit `fbda030` (PR #358), titled \"chore: Remove inert Carbon CSS rules from reports app\". I found no ticket key for this change.\n\n**Why they could never match**\n\n- `reports.scss` is a CSS Module. Plain class selectors in it get rewritten to module-scoped names, and Carbon's `cds--*` classes are global, so the rewritten selectors match nothing in the DOM.\n- The repo already uses the correct pattern in `concept-search-results.scss`, which wraps the Carbon class in `:global(...)`.\n- I did not render the page or inspect the built CSS to confirm this at runtime. The explanation rests on the selectors and the CSS Modules setup.\n\n**What was done**\n\n- Commit `fbda030` (PR #358, authored by solomonfortune, co-authored by Dennis Kigen) deleted the four nested Carbon rules, each setting `width: 100%`. The `.formField` block itself stayed.\n- Commit `feb0ba0` later removed other unreferenced CSS Module classes in the same app, but it does not touch these Carbon rules.\n- Nothing in the history I could reach names a ticket. The commit messages carry only the PR number. I searched commit messages for \"inert\", \"Carbon\", \"full width\" and \"dropdown\", plus the reports app's path history.\n\n**Evidence, best first**\n\n- openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/reports.scss:104-130 (the `.filterForm` / `.formField` block; the removed rules were nested inside it, as the diff shows)\n- openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/concept-search/concept-search-results.scss:43-45 (the `:global(.cds--skeleton__text)` pattern that does work)\n- openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/run-report/run-report-form.scss:29-31 (a module-local `.datePicker` class, showing the module-class pattern used in this app)\n\n**Commits and PRs**\n\n- `fbda030326a3a0a691844ad052fe7aed34ca44ac` removes the rules (its diff targets `reports.scss` lines 117–137 before the change).\n- `feb0ba00e3382e0c55e4b3615648217d7d619198` is related cleanup of unused CSS Module classes.\n- PR #358 is referenced in the commit title.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/reports.scss\", \"startLine\": 104, \"endLine\": 130},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/concept-search/concept-search-results.scss\", \"startLine\": 43, \"endLine\": 45},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-admin-tools/packages/esm-reports-app/src/components/run-report/run-report-form.scss\", \"startLine\": 29, \"endLine\": 31},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-admin-tools\", \"commit\": \"fbda030326a3a0a691844ad052fe7aed34ca44ac\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-admin-tools\", \"commit\": \"feb0ba00e3382e0c55e4b3615648217d7d619198\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-esm-admin-tools\", \"pr\": 358}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3876,"cache_read_input_tokens":43422,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3876},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e61a1683-ce31-4d70-9e70-eda9afb7f603","uuid":"81dec651-c88e-49ae-925b-89bc8c7f0af7","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:15:03.040Z","request_id":"req_011CgKdAUQNinUEBKLxcCJVh"}
